(7733903, 1274692, 141319, '<td valign="top">Ahhhhh stunning, it''s "rainy season" here and I was hoping for some storm clouds - alas seems climate change is playing up.</td>', 'Ahhhhh stunning, it''s "rainy season" here and I was hoping for some storm clouds - alas seems climate change is playing up.', '2022-12-05 01:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7733904, 1274733, 141319, '<td valign="top">Brilliant!! Haven''t seen all the images yet, but this one will be hard to beat.</td>', 'Brilliant!! Haven''t seen all the images yet, but this one will be hard to beat.', '2022-12-05 01:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7733905, 1274736, 141319, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Last night I looked at the moon hiding behind some clouds and was wondering if I should grab my camera and try for a moon sky shot. Love your clouds.</td>', 'Very cool. Last night I looked at the moon hiding behind some clouds and was wondering if I should grab my camera and try for a moon sky shot. Love your clouds.', '2022-12-05 01:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7733906, 1274734, 141319, '<td valign="top">Very cool clouds, the lower part of your sky looks green on my monitor ... :-(</td>', 'Very cool clouds, the lower part of your sky looks green on my monitor ... :-(', '2022-12-05 01:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7733907, 1274723, 141319, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2022-12-05 01:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7733908, 1274697, 141319, '<td valign="top">Well done, taking a different approach!</td>', 'Well done, taking a different approach!', '2022-12-05 01:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7733909, 1274610, 141319, '<td valign="top">Lovely image. Although the foreground plays an important role, IMO it is still the sky that draws the eye. Excellent presentation for the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely image. Although the foreground plays an important role, IMO it is still the sky that draws the eye. Excellent presentation for the challenge.', '2022-12-05 01:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7733910, 1274712, 141319, '<td valign="top">The crop makes the image look skew. Your clouds are beautiful though</td>', 'The crop makes the image look skew. Your clouds are beautiful though', '2022-12-05 01:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7733911, 1274737, 141319, '<td valign="top">Its a rainbow bridge :-). Not sure about the crop. The main point is really the rainbow and there is a lot of "sky and clouds" in the picture ...</td>', 'Its a rainbow bridge :-). Not sure about the crop. The main point is really the rainbow and there is a lot of "sky and clouds" in the picture ...', '2022-12-05 01:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7733912, 1274724, 141319, '<td valign="top">Marks for creativity!</td>', 'Marks for creativity!', '2022-12-05 01:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7733913, 1274731, 141319, '<td valign="top">This image is very noisy. Looks like you pushed vibrancy/saturation too much, maybe detail. But nice idea</td>', 'This image is very noisy. Looks like you pushed vibrancy/saturation too much, maybe detail. But nice idea', '2022-12-05 01:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7733914, 1274743, 141319, '<td valign="top">Too grainy/noisy for my taste.</td>', 'Too grainy/noisy for my taste.', '2022-12-05 01:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7733915, 1274709, 141319, '<td valign="top">The sky adds to the "tropical feel" for sure, but IMO, your foreground plays too much a role for this challenge.</td>', 'The sky adds to the "tropical feel" for sure, but IMO, your foreground plays too much a role for this challenge.', '2022-12-05 01:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7733916, 1274740, 141319, '<td valign="top">a bit noisy and to me the trees are "unbalancing" the image - not quite in the center, not filling the bottom part ...</td>', 'a bit noisy and to me the trees are "unbalancing" the image - not quite in the center, not filling the bottom part ...', '2022-12-05 02:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7733917, 1274721, 141319, '<td valign="top">Dramatic sky for sure!</td>', 'Dramatic sky for sure!', '2022-12-05 02:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7733918, 1274708, 141319, '<td valign="top">Loss of detail in the darks in the mountains, otherwise very nice image. The sky definitely plays the leading role!</td>', 'Loss of detail in the darks in the mountains, otherwise very nice image. The sky definitely plays the leading role!', '2022-12-05 02:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7733919, 1274735, 141319, '<td valign="top">It''s all about the sky here and the land elements just give it some "orientation" very nice. A bit too saturated for my taste.</td>', 'It''s all about the sky here and the land elements just give it some "orientation" very nice. A bit too saturated for my taste.', '2022-12-05 02:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7733920, 1274719, 141319, '<td valign="top">I think the foreground is too dominant for this challenge. Love the clouds you found!</td>', 'I think the foreground is too dominant for this challenge. Love the clouds you found!', '2022-12-05 02:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7733921, 1274707, 141319, '<td valign="top">Very noisy</td>', 'Very noisy', '2022-12-05 02:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7733922, 1274669, 141319, '<td valign="top">I feel you overprocessed the details a bit too much and also the colours. Composition and subject (clouds) are great though.</td>', 'I feel you overprocessed the details a bit too much and also the colours. Composition and subject (clouds) are great though.', '2022-12-05 02:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734248, 1274610, 42733, '<td valign="top">In my top three for this challenge.</td>', 'In my top three for this challenge.', '2022-12-09 09:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734249, 1274735, 42733, '<td valign="top">In my top three for this challenge.</td>', 'In my top three for this challenge.', '2022-12-09 09:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734250, 1274692, 42733, '<td valign="top">My favorite in this challenge.</td>', 'My favorite in this challenge.', '2022-12-09 09:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734320, 1274712, 30049, '<td valign="top">Noise reduction washed out some detail and dynamics.  I do like the color at the horizon/tree line.</td>', 'Noise reduction washed out some detail and dynamics.  I do like the color at the horizon/tree line.', '2022-12-10 12:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734321, 1274740, 30049, '<td valign="top">Torn on whether the bare trees help or hurt this comp.  Lovely color in the sky nonetheless.  Good luck.</td>', 'Torn on whether the bare trees help or hurt this comp.  Lovely color in the sky nonetheless.  Good luck.', '2022-12-10 12:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734322, 1274708, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice scene for sure.  May be a tad heavy on post with noise reduction (why do people try to wash out all noise and lose detail?).</td>', 'Nice scene for sure.  May be a tad heavy on post with noise reduction (why do people try to wash out all noise and lose detail?).', '2022-12-10 12:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734323, 1274720, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very lovely sky.  Just enough foreground to anchor it without becoming the subject.  Could be a tad underexposed.  Did you try shifting the levels a bit?</td>', 'Very lovely sky.  Just enough foreground to anchor it without becoming the subject.  Could be a tad underexposed.  Did you try shifting the levels a bit?', '2022-12-10 12:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734324, 1274723, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image.  Just enough foreground to balance the comp without becoming the subject.  May be a little heavy on noise reduction.  I may come back to see this one on my better monitor (on my laptop it looks like a little more sharpening could have helped).  Good luck.</td>', 'This is a nice image.  Just enough foreground to balance the comp without becoming the subject.  May be a little heavy on noise reduction.  I may come back to see this one on my better monitor (on my laptop it looks like a little more sharpening could have helped).  Good luck.', '2022-12-10 12:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734325, 1274692, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ah DAMN!  Jumping out.  Yeah, I''d say you nailed it here.  Well done!</td>', 'Ah DAMN!  Jumping out.  Yeah, I''d say you nailed it here.  Well done!', '2022-12-10 12:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
