(7734346, 1274721, 67145, '<td valign="top">so i looked everywhere for the bats . !! .. <br/>am i blind or are you messing with me . !! .. ;)<br/>anyway .. i really like this .. its like life goes on .. but there''s a storm brewing .. and who knows how viscous its going to be .. some of the shapes in those clouds make me think of demons .. although i dont actually believe in them .. hope this little hamlet cam out unscathed .. :)</td>', 'so i looked everywhere for the bats . !! .. am i blind or are you messing with me . !! .. ;)anyway .. i really like this .. its like life goes on .. but there''s a storm brewing .. and who knows how viscous its going to be .. some of the shapes in those clouds make me think of demons .. although i dont actually believe in them .. hope this little hamlet cam out unscathed .. :)', '2022-12-10 23:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
