(7734358, 1274692, 67145, '<td valign="top">WOWSERS .. !! .. <br/>what an incredibly catch .. <br/>the shape of those clouds is just phenomenal .. so unusual .. and then the light in the centre .. like a miracle .. stunning image for this challenge .. :)<br/>i''m thinking blue .. but i have only seen a couple of your competition ..<br/>i''ll be back .. think arnold in terminator .. !! .. ;)<br/> <br/>so i came back after voting on your competition .. this is up there .. bumping you up from 8 to 9 .. :)</td>', 'WOWSERS .. !! .. what an incredibly catch .. the shape of those clouds is just phenomenal .. so unusual .. and then the light in the centre .. like a miracle .. stunning image for this challenge .. :)i''m thinking blue .. but i have only seen a couple of your competition ..i''ll be back .. think arnold in terminator .. !! .. ;) so i came back after voting on your competition .. this is up there .. bumping you up from 8 to 9 .. :)', '2022-12-10 23:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734395, 1274735, 30049, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2022-12-11 21:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734396, 1274733, 173844, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s hard to see the sky for the snow, but we''re looking up and it''s mesmerizing.  The trees in the foreground are hardly more than a suggested smudge, but all the more powerful and moving for that.  And the middleground a merest vapor up halfway into the scene.  This tender minimalism is, to me, beautiful.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Maybe it''s hard to see the sky for the snow, but we''re looking up and it''s mesmerizing.  The trees in the foreground are hardly more than a suggested smudge, but all the more powerful and moving for that.  And the middleground a merest vapor up halfway into the scene.  This tender minimalism is, to me, beautiful.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2022-12-11 21:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734397, 1274610, 30049, '<td valign="top">What''s up with the pavillion?  Seems like a strange place for one.  The sheep are a nice addition to this awesome <strike>landscape</strike> skyscape.  Awesome sky too! :-)</td>', 'What''s up with the pavillion?  Seems like a strange place for one.  The sheep are a nice addition to this awesome landscape skyscape.  Awesome sky too! :-)', '2022-12-11 21:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734398, 1274735, 173844, '<td valign="top">A trumpet fanfare of color, tooted by the sun.  Must be awe-inspiring to be in its midst.  What I really like is the orange reflection broken into a fluid mosaic.  Strong image.</td>', 'A trumpet fanfare of color, tooted by the sun.  Must be awe-inspiring to be in its midst.  What I really like is the orange reflection broken into a fluid mosaic.  Strong image.', '2022-12-11 21:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734400, 1274712, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones and colors billowing over the lightly positioned trees.  Yes foreboding, but there''s a sense of the transitory peeking through from behind.  Exciting and well done.<br/>Personal second-favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely tones and colors billowing over the lightly positioned trees.  Yes foreboding, but there''s a sense of the transitory peeking through from behind.  Exciting and well done.Personal second-favorite of the challenge.', '2022-12-11 21:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734401, 1274723, 173844, '<td valign="top">Humongous invasion of a cloud mass, rushing forward, maw open and eye ablaze.  Impressive sense of implacable nature, of human insignificance.  Beautiful definition and color.</td>', 'Humongous invasion of a cloud mass, rushing forward, maw open and eye ablaze.  Impressive sense of implacable nature, of human insignificance.  Beautiful definition and color.', '2022-12-11 21:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734402, 1274692, 173844, '<td valign="top">Amazing orange-yellow loop, a boomerang of fire wielded by ancient Australian spirits, no matter where this is actually photographed.  The peaceful water is a nice foil to the sky. Wonder what happened next.</td>', 'Amazing orange-yellow loop, a boomerang of fire wielded by ancient Australian spirits, no matter where this is actually photographed.  The peaceful water is a nice foil to the sky. Wonder what happened next.', '2022-12-11 21:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734403, 1274669, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sky; seems a bit overcooked, please pardon me if I''m off base here.  I like the grain and sculptural quality.  Operatic.  Beautiful foreground, the sensuous hills, the luscious colors.  Painterly, making a strong statement.</td>', 'Wonderful sky; seems a bit overcooked, please pardon me if I''m off base here.  I like the grain and sculptural quality.  Operatic.  Beautiful foreground, the sensuous hills, the luscious colors.  Painterly, making a strong statement.', '2022-12-11 22:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734404, 1274697, 173844, '<td valign="top">Masterful abstract, the chocolate bottom and the lovely tinted sky.  It''s kind of all you need to know.</td>', 'Masterful abstract, the chocolate bottom and the lovely tinted sky.  It''s kind of all you need to know.', '2022-12-11 22:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734405, 1274735, 114285, '<td valign="top">Spectacular image! Bump, should do well.</td>', 'Spectacular image! Bump, should do well.', '2022-12-11 22:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734406, 1274743, 173844, '<td valign="top">They seem to dance together in nonpareil sky.  If seen through a telescope, it could be two nebulae drawing towards each other in starry deep space.  Delicately suggestive, playful and ephemeral.  Quite enjoyable.</td>', 'They seem to dance together in nonpareil sky.  If seen through a telescope, it could be two nebulae drawing towards each other in starry deep space.  Delicately suggestive, playful and ephemeral.  Quite enjoyable.', '2022-12-11 22:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734407, 1274742, 173844, '<td valign="top">Here, the title seems to make it so.  All you have to do is supply the narrative.  And I don''t know why, but there you go.  Flavorful.</td>', 'Here, the title seems to make it so.  All you have to do is supply the narrative.  And I don''t know why, but there you go.  Flavorful.', '2022-12-11 22:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734410, 1274734, 173844, '<td valign="top">It''s a whole ''nother world  up there, as this image startlingly shows.  This vivid, transitory menagerie plays itself out and transforms into never-ending new scenes, amazing and vivid in their own uniqueness.  Enchantingly presented, alive and stunning.</td>', 'It''s a whole ''nother world  up there, as this image startlingly shows.  This vivid, transitory menagerie plays itself out and transforms into never-ending new scenes, amazing and vivid in their own uniqueness.  Enchantingly presented, alive and stunning.', '2022-12-11 22:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734411, 1274713, 173844, '<td valign="top">Handsomely presented, nice composition.  It''s fresh and light above, yet just tucking itself to bed below.  Beautiful blue, with that little nick of the moon.  I love the lights on the boats below, echoing a star-studded sky.</td>', 'Handsomely presented, nice composition.  It''s fresh and light above, yet just tucking itself to bed below.  Beautiful blue, with that little nick of the moon.  I love the lights on the boats below, echoing a star-studded sky.', '2022-12-11 22:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734412, 1274610, 173844, '<td valign="top">Enchanting crepuscular rays, blessing all below.  Almost looks like a volcanic eruption.  Lends a singular serenity to the scene.  Works hand in hand with the grazing sheep.  Yet there''s a gentle modesty here, suggesting, "have a look."</td>', 'Enchanting crepuscular rays, blessing all below.  Almost looks like a volcanic eruption.  Lends a singular serenity to the scene.  Works hand in hand with the grazing sheep.  Yet there''s a gentle modesty here, suggesting, "have a look."', '2022-12-11 22:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7734418, 1274719, 68504, '<td valign="top">I was quite taken by the curb and fence lines echoing the cloud trails.</td>', 'I was quite taken by the curb and fence lines echoing the cloud trails.', '2022-12-12 00:13:48.000000', NULL, 0),
